(5239494, 762602, 100227, '<td valign="top">straight on photos of text, drawings, or paintings come off as either boring or unoriginal (in the case of photographing other art).  Add more props, interesting angles, framing, or something to that effect.  A photo of a frustrated person losing at an actual Pac-Man arcade game would be cool, for instance.</td>', 'straight on photos of text, drawings, or paintings come off as either boring or unoriginal (in the case of photographing other art).  Add more props, interesting angles, framing, or something to that effect.  A photo of a frustrated person losing at an actual Pac-Man arcade game would be cool, for instance.', '2009-02-04 16:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
