(5239584, 762367, 86447, '<td valign="top">The subject has to compete too much with the trail...   Most folks don''t like centered compositions around here... so cropping this on the left side and the trail off the bottom would make this a better composition, I think.  Unfortunately, I don''t think the image quality could stand the crop.   A closer up photo would have been better, IMO.</td>', 'The subject has to compete too much with the trail...   Most folks don''t like centered compositions around here... so cropping this on the left side and the trail off the bottom would make this a better composition, I think.  Unfortunately, I don''t think the image quality could stand the crop.   A closer up photo would have been better, IMO.', '2009-02-04 17:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5239616, 762539, 103142, '<td valign="top">I know what it''s about, and I like the title, but this angle is a little odd to me. I think I would have liked to see more of the stone.</td>', 'I know what it''s about, and I like the title, but this angle is a little odd to me. I think I would have liked to see more of the stone.', '2009-02-04 17:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
