(5240790, 762648, 99263, '<td valign="top">WOW! Absolute stunner of an image. One of the best in the challenge and deserving of a ribbon. Fantastic lighting and superb detail. Fits the challenge so very very well. I love the wallpaper and the shadow of the plant against it. The wilted flower adds a strong feeling of despair and lonelyless.</td>', 'WOW! Absolute stunner of an image. One of the best in the challenge and deserving of a ribbon. Fantastic lighting and superb detail. Fits the challenge so very very well. I love the wallpaper and the shadow of the plant against it. The wilted flower adds a strong feeling of despair and lonelyless.', '2009-02-05 12:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
