(5240796, 760890, 99263, '<td valign="top">Superb image. Such powerful emotions being transmitted here. Fantastic natural setting combined with brilliant composition. Deep range of emotions that jump out at the viewer. Fantastic title that incorporates the full spectrum of emotion and feeling whilst illustrating the challenge theme completely. Technically also excellent with a full range of tones and lovely muted colors. Superb detail and excellent dof. Great use of natural lighting.</td>', 'Superb image. Such powerful emotions being transmitted here. Fantastic natural setting combined with brilliant composition. Deep range of emotions that jump out at the viewer. Fantastic title that incorporates the full spectrum of emotion and feeling whilst illustrating the challenge theme completely. Technically also excellent with a full range of tones and lovely muted colors. Superb detail and excellent dof. Great use of natural lighting.', '2009-02-05 12:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
