(5240826, 760796, 99263, '<td valign="top">Powerful image that is brilliantly executed with a full range of tones and superb contrast. The concept displays out of the box thinking and conveys all the despair and hopelessness of love lost and the end of dreams in a poignant manner. Lovely composition also with a fantastic feeling of depth.</td>', 'Powerful image that is brilliantly executed with a full range of tones and superb contrast. The concept displays out of the box thinking and conveys all the despair and hopelessness of love lost and the end of dreams in a poignant manner. Lovely composition also with a fantastic feeling of depth.', '2009-02-05 12:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
