(5240830, 762580, 99263, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photograph. Gives a powerful message about the "END" being always present and that one has to be careful at all times. I love the purple socks and black and white striped socks. It makes a visual feast of this image combined with the black and white. Lots of depth and detail in this too.</td>', 'Fantastic photograph. Gives a powerful message about the "END" being always present and that one has to be careful at all times. I love the purple socks and black and white striped socks. It makes a visual feast of this image combined with the black and white. Lots of depth and detail in this too.', '2009-02-05 12:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
