(5240861, 762643, 99263, '<td valign="top">Rusty,bent,twisted and entwined remains of once useful articles and objects including cars, corrugated iron,empty drums tires and an odd assortment of other unidentified objects join together to form a masterly image of great beauty with a deep message and at the same time fits in extremely well with the challenge theme. I especially like that one can still see a small part of nature in the background as evidenced by the trees and the way it forms a contrast with the rest of the image. Almost as if to say..."look! this is nature, fresh and sustainable and full of life and fresh beginnings" and the rusty, bent twisted and entwined remains of once useful articles and objects including cars, corrugated iron,empty drums tires and an odd assortment of other unidentified objects just lie there, silent and dead and of no more use.</td>', 'Rusty,bent,twisted and entwined remains of once useful articles and objects including cars, corrugated iron,empty drums tires and an odd assortment of other unidentified objects join together to form a masterly image of great beauty with a deep message and at the same time fits in extremely well with the challenge theme. I especially like that one can still see a small part of nature in the background as evidenced by the trees and the way it forms a contrast with the rest of the image. Almost as if to say..."look! this is nature, fresh and sustainable and full of life and fresh beginnings" and the rusty, bent twisted and entwined remains of once useful articles and objects including cars, corrugated iron,empty drums tires and an odd assortment of other unidentified objects just lie there, silent and dead and of no more use.', '2009-02-05 12:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5240862, 762635, 99263, '<td valign="top">Brilliant concept and very effectively executed. Lovely detail and contrast and very nice range of tones. The message is powerful and fits the challenge theme extremely well.I like the style of the letters too and the way they stand out against the gray if the wall. Good choice to have presented this in black and white.</td>', 'Brilliant concept and very effectively executed. Lovely detail and contrast and very nice range of tones. The message is powerful and fits the challenge theme extremely well.I like the style of the letters too and the way they stand out against the gray if the wall. Good choice to have presented this in black and white.', '2009-02-05 12:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
