(5240866, 761092, 99263, '<td valign="top">Clever if slightly macabre concept and effectively executed. It looks almost real and the expression on her face displays genuine fear of what''s about to happen. It is of course no small matter taking your own life and ending it all. A real gun might have given an even more realistic effect.</td>', 'Clever if slightly macabre concept and effectively executed. It looks almost real and the expression on her face displays genuine fear of what''s about to happen. It is of course no small matter taking your own life and ending it all. A real gun might have given an even more realistic effect.', '2009-02-05 13:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
