(5249844, 761817, 88492, '<td valign="top">The mark is a scratch on the paper background.<br/>I tried holding the bottle myself, and spilt whisky on the card.<br/>I got my wife to hold the bottle, but it wasn''t steady enough.<br/>So the back of the bottle is on a pile of books, with a rubber band round it to stop it from sliding off.<br/>Then I couldn''t read the label, so a cork inside the rubber band allowed me to adjust the position of the triangular bottle.<br/>If anyone wants to see, I have the original, showing the setup.<br/>Thanks for your votes, including one 10.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-11 04:03:46.</i></td>', 'The mark is a scratch on the paper background.I tried holding the bottle myself, and spilt whisky on the card.I got my wife to hold the bottle, but it wasn''t steady enough.So the back of the bottle is on a pile of books, with a rubber band round it to stop it from sliding off.Then I couldn''t read the label, so a cork inside the rubber band allowed me to adjust the position of the triangular bottle.If anyone wants to see, I have the original, showing the setup.Thanks for your votes, including one 10.', '2009-02-11 04:03:18.000000', '2009-02-11 04:03:46.000000', 0),
