(5256439, 762005, 100301, '<td valign="top">this was one of my favorites, I like the texture the parched ground provides.  The sunglasses placement is great for the image, but the item in your hand (a remote trigger?) doesn''t seem to fit the theme.  And just to be snarky, get a tan! :-)  I also agree that a strong contrast b&amp;w would''ve suited this image well.  <br/> <br/>Great work! <br/> <br/></td>', 'this was one of my favorites, I like the texture the parched ground provides.  The sunglasses placement is great for the image, but the item in your hand (a remote trigger?) doesn''t seem to fit the theme.  And just to be snarky, get a tan! :-)  I also agree that a strong contrast b&w would''ve suited this image well.   Great work!  ', '2009-02-14 16:59:55.000000', NULL, 0),
