(5283496, 762545, 24454, '<td valign="top">Well. . .I am one who would have probably given this a 9 or 10.  I don''t think the light is horrible at all -- and it is photojournalism, so the background isn''t supposed to be all studio-esque.  And what it represents moves me greatly.  The honor of being paid tribute for such a noble career is something very touching.  I hope someone gets a picture so moving of your retirement ceremony.   <br/> <br/>I love how you have barely humanized it with only part of the faces.  To me, that gives more attention to what it represents than just being a "people snapshot".<br/> <br/>I love it.</td>', 'Well. . .I am one who would have probably given this a 9 or 10.  I don''t think the light is horrible at all -- and it is photojournalism, so the background isn''t supposed to be all studio-esque.  And what it represents moves me greatly.  The honor of being paid tribute for such a noble career is something very touching.  I hope someone gets a picture so moving of your retirement ceremony.    I love how you have barely humanized it with only part of the faces.  To me, that gives more attention to what it represents than just being a "people snapshot". I love it.', '2009-03-02 11:31:43.000000', NULL, 0),
