(5291604, 760890, 68586, '<td valign="top">Strong shot - nice composition and attractive model. <br/> <br/>Title fits perfectly - only real critique is that the white picture frame behind his head is blown out - and as the eye is naturally drawn towards bright areas of a picture it leads the viewer away from the main action.<br/> <br/>Not much you can do about it in a bsic edit - but might be worth re-editing to see what you can do ?<br/> <br/>Very nice though</td>', 'Strong shot - nice composition and attractive model.  Title fits perfectly - only real critique is that the white picture frame behind his head is blown out - and as the eye is naturally drawn towards bright areas of a picture it leads the viewer away from the main action. Not much you can do about it in a bsic edit - but might be worth re-editing to see what you can do ? Very nice though', '2009-03-05 17:21:47.000000', NULL, 0),
